Several individuals have been removed from the list due to wealth decline, legal troubles, or death:

* '''[[Yamamoto Tetsuya]]''' (removed 2024): Formerly ranked #7 with ε9.8 billion. Removed following the collapse of [[Yamamoto Real Estate]] during the 2023 property market crash. Currently under investigation for bankruptcy fraud.
* '''[[Ishii Kenji]]''' (removed 2023): Formerly ranked #12 with ε8.1 billion. Removed after being convicted of tax evasion and sentenced to 3 years in prison. His assets were seized by the [[National Tax Agency (Okaiken)|National Tax Agency]].
* '''[[Ogawa Takashi]]''' (removed 2022): Formerly ranked #18 with ε6.5 billion. Died in 2022 at age 91. His estate was divided among 23 heirs, with none receiving enough to qualify for the list.

